    "cas_a2": "Distinct terminal path. Earlier give on the same semaphore is visible. Last owner selection read zero, exit read LOCK-only and null owner, and CPU1's final acquire observed existing LOCK and followed the blocking path. Late SPI result and LCD in-flight counts were both zero; the A1 chain is not attributed to A2.",
